rency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  - Still, major \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets are not providing much \par \par \uc2  direction either, with the dollar trimming some of its gains \par \par \uc2  against the yen after the Bank of Japan announced its decision \par \par \uc2  to leave monetary policy untouched. \par \par \uc2  - Trading in the major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also starting to slow \par \par \uc2  ahead of the Group of Seven industrialised nations meeting in \par \par \uc2  Ottawa, Canada this weekend. \par \par \uc2  - Dealers and analysts expect little news from the market. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, some say they are waiting to sell the yen after \par \par \uc2  the meeting because of Japan's bleak outlook. \par \par \uc2  - However, some dealers say the recent weakness in the U.S. \par \par \uc2  equity markets could force the dollar to retreat against the \par \par \uc2  other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the regionals. \par \par \uc2      - Indeed, Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are holding up rather \par \par \uc2  well against the dollar. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Indonesian rupiah        sticks to the right side of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 10,300 despite dollar bids by local corporates around this\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par area.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Jakarta dealers say some in the market still long on the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar after Thursday's sell-off, which was sparked by state\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par banks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - They add some players believed Thursday's dollar offers\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par were on behalf of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , increasing wariness of\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dollar        stuck right below 1.83 level,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with the market not tracking the dollar/yen as closely as it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par usually does.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Only Korean won         -2 showing much of a reaction to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the yen's movements.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     - Won manages to distance itself away from its lows of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par around 1,321 thanks to exporter sales.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020208dy28009q7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
