\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Pulled back on their feet by yen. \b0\par\par\uc2 1,180 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Januar 2002\par 10:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Jan 29 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued \par \par \uc2  their rise against the dollar late on Tuesday, spurred on by \par \par \uc2  the yen's gains. \par \par \uc2      With the Korean won leading the charge, the regional \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have been steadily inching higher against the \par \par \uc2  greenback since late last week. \par \par \uc2      Still, dealers and analysts said the bearish sentiment \par \par \uc2  towards the yen despite its recent bounce and a lack of \par \par \uc2  interest in the regional markets was preventing Asian \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  from making more rapid advances. \par \par \uc2  Given the recent dramatic moves in the major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \par \par \uc2  dealers said players were more interested in trading in the \par \par \uc2  majors, where the gains were bigger and the liquidity more \par \par \uc2  flush. \par \par \uc2  Peter Redward, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Deutsche Bank in \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 , said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also holding back \par \par \uc2  some regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "That's left the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in no man's land. With \par \par \uc2  the U.S. recovery underway, most of the regionals should be \par \par \uc2  strengthening. But then we've got central banks taking the \par \par \uc2  opportunity to build up their \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves," he said. \par \par \uc2  In recent weeks, most Asian central banks, with the \par \par \uc2  exception of Indonesia and Hong Kong, have reported a rise in \par \par \uc2  their \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  Besides regional developments, the market was also focusing \par \par \uc2  on the two-day Federal Reserve meeting which starts later in \par \par \uc2  the day. While most in the market are not expecting a rate cut, \par \par \uc2  they were waiting to see what the Fed might say about the \par \par \uc2  economy. \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar managed to claw back some territory \par \par \uc2  from its U.S. rival, but was held in check by talk the \b \highlight22\uc2 central \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have been in the market to buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was believed to have \par \par \uc2  bought a small amount of dollars around the 1.8315/20 level. \par \par \uc2  They, and others, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was probably keen to \par \par \uc2  cap the local dollar's gains given the still fragile yen and \par \par \uc2  the weaker euro, both of which are major components in the Sing \par \par \uc2  dollar's trade-weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  News that Singapore Technologies and Hong Kong's Hutchison \par \par \uc2  Whampoa were seeking to take a combined 70-80 percent stake in \par \par \uc2  Global Crossing Ltd. also weighed on the local dollar. \par \par \uc2  KOREAN WON -2 \par \par \uc2  The won was up on dollar sales by exporters for month-end \par \par \uc2  needs and on settlement of stock purchases by foreign investors \par \par \uc2  in the past two sessions in which they had picked up a net 449 \par \par \uc2  billion won of local shares. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Singapore said players were encouraged by the \par \par \uc2  correction in the dollar/yen that they believed had created \par \par \uc2  more room for the won to appreciate without resistance from \par \par \uc2  authorities. \par \par \uc2  Korean authorities have shown greater concern over the \par \par \uc2  won's competitiveness in the face of a near-term bearish \par \par \uc2  outlook for the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  given Korea's overlapping \par \par \uc2  export portfolio with Japan. \par \par \uc2  They said the yen's rebound overshadowed the steeper than \par \par \uc2  expected dip in industrial output for December. The won's \par \par \uc2  upside was expected to be capped around 1,310-1,305 for now, \par \par \uc2  but a steadier yen could allow the won to rack up more gains. \par \par \uc2  THAI BAHT \par \par \uc2  The baht advanced further against the dollar on the back of \par \par \uc2  the yen's rebound, but its gains were dented by talk of the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  coming in to check prices. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been in the market regularly lately to \par \par \uc2  pick up dollars below 44, either to top up reserves or to cap \par \par \uc2  the baht's gains against the backdrop of increased capital \par \par \uc2  inflows, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "They (the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) were in the market to check rates, \par \par \uc2  but I'm not sure if they actually bought the dollar today," \par \par \uc2  said a local dealer. \par \par \uc2  Charts showed the dollar/baht was still trapped in a \par \par \uc2  downtrend channel, indicating more gains ahead for the local \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  INDONESIAN RUPIAH \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was firmer, reflecting the regionals' trend. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Jakarta said corporate players were holding back on \par \par \uc2  dollar purchases on hopes the dollar would dip further. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was also boosted by news of the IMF approving a \par \par \uc2  US$341 million instalment under Indonesia's $4.5 billion loan \par \par \uc2  programme, and extending the loan for a year. \par \par \uc2  Separately, the IMF said on Tuesday it was confident the \par \par \uc2  divestment of Indonesia's largest retail bank, Bank Central \par \par \uc2  Asia (BCA), would be well managed but said the sale should be \par \par \uc2  wound up swiftly. \par \par \uc2  In the money market, Bank Indonesia kept its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  rates in the rupiah interbank money market unchanged at 15.125 \par \par \uc2  percent for the overnight rate and 15.875 percent for the 7-day \par \par \uc2  rate. \par \par \uc2  TAIWAN DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  The Taiwan dollar held steady but gave up its early gains \par \par \uc2  following a 2.68 percent fall in the local stock market and \par \par \uc2  dollar sales by a foreign bank suspected to be executing an \par \par \uc2  order placed by a foreign equity fund manager. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Singapore said despite the yen's rebound and \par \par \uc2  some recent positive data flow, stock market losses and \par \par \uc2  wariness over the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's repeated dollar-purchase \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  has dampened market sentiment and could keep the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a tight range around the 35 per dollar level. \par \par \uc2  Foreign investors sold a net T$553.5 million of local \par \par \uc2  shares on Tuesday, following net sales of T$463.2 million on \par \par \uc2  Monday. \par \par \uc2  PHILIPPINE PESO \par \par \uc2  The Philippine peso was locked in a tight range of \par \par \uc2  51.16-51.23, ending the day at 51.165 as it tracked the yen and \par \par \uc2  regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Trading was brisk with $134.2 million changing hands. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Manila said bargain-hunting importers swooped in \par \par \uc2  to buy dollars when it fell below 51.20, while exporters wanted \par \par \uc2  to sell the greenback around 51.30. \par \par \uc2  Many importers hedged their dollar requirements in the \par \par \uc2  forward market just before 2002 and have been sitting on the \par \par \uc2  sidelines so far. But dealers said corporates may come back at \par \par \uc2  the right price. \par \par \uc2  Still, they expect the peso to be trapped in its familiar \par \par \uc2  range ahead of the Fed's announcement and economic data \par \par \uc2  including fourth quarter gross domestic product due on \par \par \uc2  Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0831 GMT \par \par \uc2   Change on the day \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     133.09       133.72         +0.47\par  Sing dlr      1.8325       1.8354         +0.16\par  Taiwan dlr    35.001       35.015         +0.04\par  Korean won   1313.60      1321.30         +0.05\par  Baht           44.01        44.08         +0.16\par  Peso           51.15        51.24         +0.18\par  Rupiah      10315.00     10385.00         +0.68\par  Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995         +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     133.09       131.24         -1.39\par  Sing dlr      1.8325       1.8515         +1.04\par  Taiwan dlr    35.001       34.986         -0.04\par  Korean won   1303.60      1313.00         +0.72\par  Baht           44.01        44.16         +0.34\par  Peso           51.15        51.50         +0.68\par  Rupiah      10315.00     10350.00         +0.34\par  Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995         +0.00.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020129dy1t00jn0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
