\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore dlr pushing 11 = year lows, MAS eyed. \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Dezember 2001\par 02:42\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Dec 27 (Reuters) - The Singapore dollar was falling to precariously near 1.8540 - last hit on June 30, 1990 - on Thursday as the country's gloomy economic outlook and the sliding yen set off a new round of U.S. dollar short covering. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell to 1.8520 overnight before clawing back some gains in early Asian trading due to wariness of potential \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Our synthesised basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  suggests there might be some form of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  (if the Sing fell) below 1.8480. I don't think the U.S. dollar will go much further from here," said a senior dealer at a U.S. bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  The losses were also exaggerated by thin trading volumes. \par \par \uc2  The yen, which carries substantial weight in Singapore's undisclosed trade-weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fell to a fresh three-year low of 131.33 to the dollar in early trade in Tokyo. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore market hardly drew any support from a better than expected manufacturing data on Wednesday. November production fell 13.60 percent on the year against a revised 20.60 percent contraction in October. \par \par \uc2  Although the figure came in better than the market expectation of a 21 percent decline, analysts said it was still a sharp year-on-year decline. \par \par \uc2  "It might be too early to assume the economy is bottoming out. There is not much good news out there to support the Sing dollar," said a dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011227dxcr00392\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
