\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  - Rupiah slides to 10-week lows. \b0\par\par\uc2 1,046 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2001\par 03:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Oct 8 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  were \par \par \uc2  grappling with uncertainty in the wake of U.S. and British \par \par \uc2  attacks on Afghanistan, with the first inclination being to \par \par \uc2  mark down the Indonesian rupiah to a 10-week low. \par \par \uc2      Trading volumes were thin with Tokyo off on holiday and \par \par \uc2  dealers reported some proxy selling of the Singapore dollar as \par \par \uc2  one of the more liquid \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the region, taking that to \par \par \uc2  its lowest level in nine weeks. \par \par \uc2      "A lot of focus will be on how things unfold over the next \par \par \uc2  few days...the level of the joint attacks and any \par \par \uc2  counterattacks by the terrorists," said Lee Boon Keng, market \par \par \uc2  strategist at DBS Bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2      "In the near-term, this could put some pressure on the \par \par \uc2  dollar But (the military \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) looked pretty \par \par \uc2  well-contained at this point," he said. \par \par \uc2      Dollar bulls were disappointed that there was no discussion \par \par \uc2  at the Group of Seven meeting of joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market over the weekend. \par \par \uc2      The G7 finance ministers' words in their communique -- "We \par \par \uc2  will continue to monitor exchange markets closely and cooperate \par \par \uc2  as appropriate" -- merely mirrored those they have made about \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in their past statements. \par \par \uc2      Elsewhere, South Korea's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said after an \par \par \uc2  emergency meeting on Monday it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market in \par \par \uc2  case of volatility. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  is scheduled to publish its third quarter gross \par \par \uc2  domestic product data on Thursday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Singapore dollar was hovering around 1.7900 per dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par after hitting an early low at 1.7910.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     It was finding some support from a rise in the yen beyond\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 120.00 per dollar -- many regionals tend to track the Japanese\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "I think the initial reaction is to sell the dollar, but it\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par depends on what dollar/yen does. The market could be quite\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par volatile," said a European bank trader.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     He added there could be some dollar buying around 1.7750/60\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from players caught short of dollars on Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah slid past 10,000 in early trade as the market\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par feared the U.S. attacks in Afghanistan could spark protests\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from Muslim hard-liners in Indonesia.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Indeed, a Muslim extremist group called for a siege of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par U.S. embassy in Jakarta early on Monday. These groups are a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par small, but vocal minority in Indonesia, which is the world's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par most populous Muslim nation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par However, political analysts warn that President Megawati\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sukarnoputri, who has only been in office for two months, has\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to strike a delicate balance between backing the United States\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and appeasing radical Muslims.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers in Jakarta said the market was also nervous that\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par these protests would give foreign investors another reason to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par avoid Indonesia, which is struggling to piece together its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par shattered economy.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah was quoted around 10,200 but the bid/offer\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par spread had widened out to a full 100 rupiah suggesting few\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par traders actually wanted to deal in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "Even if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , they can't do much\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for the rupiah," said a European bank dealer in Jakarta.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     KOREAN WON         -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The won bounced in line with the yen, but the threat of\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  kept the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on its best behaviour.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The government said before trading began on Monday the Bank\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of Korea would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  if it saw volatility in the domestic\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market. The statement was issued after an\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par emergency meeting of economic ministers following news of the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par U.S.-led attack on the Taliban.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par THAI BAHT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The baht firmed at first as some offshore names sold the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par U.S. dollar in a knee-jerk reaction to the attacks, but soon\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lost the gains as the whole region suffered from risk aversion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's downside was supported by talk of the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  buying dollars below 44.60 to top up its reserve\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and to repay IMF debt.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Otherwise, trade was thin as market participants were\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par reluctant to take fresh positions amid uncertainty following\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the attacks on Afghanistan.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the offshore market, the one-month forward rate was\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par quoted at 9/13 satang per dollar and the tom/next rate at 0/0.5\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par satang.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The peso edged up on wariness over \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to stem exchange rate volatility.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers in Manila said the peso rose as interbank players,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par taking their cue from the yen, squared out of their long dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par positions.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Corporates and importers also kept on the sidelines amid\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par fears any volatile moves in the peso would draw the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  into the market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said there was some concern about a rally in front\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of the U.S. Embassy in Manila against the bombing of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Afghanistan but few expected the protest to turn violent.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     A dealer at a U.S. bank said the peso was likely to stay in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par a tight 51.50-51.60 range for the day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     TAIWAN DOLLAR\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Taiwan dollar followed the yen's rise but players were\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cautious ahead of trade data for September due later in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers in Singapore said worries about the direction local\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par stocks would take and fears the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may deter any\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sharp move in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market would cap any significant\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par gains in the Taiwan dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The benchmark TAIEX         index was down 1.61 percent by\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0122 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0117 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     119.82       120.49         +0.56\par  Sing dlr      1.7890       1.7842         -0.27\par  Taiwan dlr    34.525       34.559         +0.10\par  Korean won   1302.00      1311.00         +0.69\par  Baht           44.67        44.69         +0.06\par  Peso           51.45        51.57         +0.22\par  Rupiah       9975.00      9830.00         -1.45\par  Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995         +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     119.82       114.45         -4.48\par  Sing dlr      1.7890       1.7365         -2.93\par  Taiwan dlr    34.525       32.900         -4.71\par  Korean won   1302.00      1277.00         -1.92\par  Baht           44.67        43.70         -2.16\par  Peso           51.45        50.75         -1.36\par  Rupiah       9975.00      9470.00         -5.06\par  Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995         +0.00.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011008dxa8002xn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
