\par\par \b \uc2  Emerging  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 -Locked in range, dlr cuts losses on GDP. \b0\par\par\uc2 1,066 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 August 2001\par 04:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2001 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      SINGAPORE, Aug 30 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  retreated in \par \par \uc2  early trade on Thursday as the dollar recouped some lost ground \par \par \uc2  after the U.S. reported its economy continued to grow in the \par \par \uc2  second quarter. \par \par \uc2      The government said the U.S. economy grew at a modest rate \par \par \uc2  of 0.2 percent in the second quarter -- its slowest pace in \par \par \uc2  more than eight years and well below a previous growth reading \par \par \uc2  of 0.7 percent. \par \par \uc2      Despite the dollar rebound, some dealers doubted if the \par \par \uc2  latest round of what they believed was dollar correction had \par \par \uc2  come to an end. \par \par \uc2      Merrill Lynch said its recent global investor survey showed \par \par \uc2  exposure to the dollar had fallen to its third-lowest level in \par \par \uc2  the 12-year history of the survey, while investors had not \par \par \uc2  reduced exposure in any other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      However, this impact on the yen could be limited due to \par \par \uc2  Japan's economic problems. Its top financial diplomat Haruhiko \par \par \uc2  Kuroda said on Thursday the current yen level was not \par \par \uc2  reflecting economic fundamentals. \par \par \uc2      Since most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  tracked the yen closely, the \par \par \uc2  dollar correction might have only a mild impact on them as \par \par \uc2  well, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      Elsewhere in the region, the market is eyeing fresh \par \par \uc2  economic data for trading direction. The Philippines will \par \par \uc2  release its second quarter gross domestic product data later in \par \par \uc2  the day. \par \par \uc2      On Friday, Hong Kong will publish its second quarter GDP \par \par \uc2  data, and Thailand will announce its monthly key economic \par \par \uc2  indicators. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SINGAPORE DOLLAR\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Sing dollar ambled aimlessly in early trade, with\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dealers expecting it to move within a recent 1.7450-1.7550\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par range ahead of the European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's meeting later in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The euro carries substantial weight in Singapore's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trade-weighted basket.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Dealers said news that SingTel           would soon\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par finalise a deal with Cable & Wireless Optus Ltd could\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cap the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's upside in the near-term.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     SingTel said on Wednesday its US$9 billion bid for Optus\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par would be declared unconditional by August 30.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Although the news has largely been discounted by the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market, dealers said they were not sure how much more the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par company might need to buy from \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to cover the deal.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     THAI BAHT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The baht edged lower as some U.S. names chased the dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from 44.20 in early trade to cover positions after the dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par perked up overnight.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     But dealers in Bangkok said the dollar was likely to\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par struggle to breach 44.30 where dollar profit taking and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par exporter offers would emerge.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Baht sentiment remained poor. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Wednesday\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cut its forecast for economic growth this year to 1.5-2.0\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par percent from a previous projection of 2-3 percent due to a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par slowdown in exports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Despite the forecast downgrade, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  kept its\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par benchmark 14-day repo rate unchanged at 2.5 percent.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     INDONESIAN RUPIAH\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The rupiah was on the wrong side of the 9,000 mark weighed\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par down by dollar demand from local corporates for debt\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par repayments.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dealers said Wednesday's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to support the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was likely to keep players\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par cautious but they added players would continue to test levels\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par beyond 9,200.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, the benchmark one-month SBI certificates rate\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rose to 17.67 percent in Wednesday's auction from 17.61 in the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par previous auction. Dealers said that also indicated the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par \f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 \par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would continue to support the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The auction results came after the IMF warned Indonesia\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par against lowering interest rates too quickly given a steadily\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par rising inflation now at above 13 percent.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par KOREAN WON -2\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With the yen back on the wrong side of 120, the won edged\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par towards the lower end of its recent 1,275-1,292.1 range where\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par it has been trapped since August 3.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The won has been caught between a tug of a war between\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par exporters' dollar sales and fears of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers said the market was wary of testing the won's upside as\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the authorities are believed to be keen on protecting the price\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par competitiveness of Korea's exports.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Looking ahead, the market was keeping its eye on July\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par industrial output data and August consumer price index, both\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par due on Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TAIWAN DOLLAR\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Gains on the local stock market and month-end exporters'\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar sales sent the Taiwan dollar slightly higher.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But the market was wary of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  after\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the bank was suspected of selling U.S. dollars on the market in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par late trade on Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves of over $110 billion, the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been active in smoothing over volatility in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the exchange rate.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PHILIPPINE PESO\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Local corporate dollar demand was expected to drag the peso\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par towards 51.30.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But Manila dealers said they suspected the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par seek to protect the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  around that level. They added,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par though, the bank was also believed to be buying dollar on dips\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par through major foreign banks to pad its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "They're keeping it within a band, and trading has come\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par down to what they can tolerate on the peso's downside," said a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par local bank dealer in Manila.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Still, with import season coming into full swing in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par September, dealers said the peso would continue to weaken.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The market was also watching out for second-quarter GDP\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par data due later in the day. A Reuters poll showed economists on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par average forecast 2.25 percent growth on the year.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 CURRENCIES\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  VS U.S. DOLLAR  0146 GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on the day\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2     Latest bid     Prev Close    Pct Move\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Japan yen     120.01       119.92         -0.07\par  Sing dlr      1.7500       1.7500         +0.00\par  Taiwan dlr    34.577       34.593         +0.05\par  Korean won   1284.10      1281.10         -0.23\par  Baht           44.30        44.23         -0.16\par  Peso           51.22        51.19         -0.06\par  Rupiah       9050.00      9090.00         +0.44\par  Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995         +0.00\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Change on year\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2       Latest     End prev yr     Pct Move\par  Japan yen     120.01       114.45         -4.63\par  Sing dlr      1.7500       1.7365         -0.77\par  Taiwan dlr    34.577       32.900         -4.85\par  Korean won   1284.10      1277.00         -0.55\par  Baht           44.30        43.70         -1.35\par  Peso           51.22        50.75         -0.92\par  Rupiah       9050.00      9470.00         +4.64\par  Ringgit       3.7995       3.7995         +0.00.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010830dx8u00461\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
